    "Every entry is a quiet vote for who you're becoming — private, and yours alone. Choose what you'd like to track; add, rename, or hide sections anytime." : {

    },
    "Every few minutes" : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.outcomes.everywhere.rows.live.cells.account. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Every fix and new section is built by one developer. Supporting is the most direct way to say “keep going.”" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada correção e cada nova seção é feita por um único desenvolvedor. Apoiar é a forma mais direta de dizer “continue”."
          }
